        "sha256": "8c2d5a7e338444d76aeb0c35ad1024619c883a8eac284e351f0529256b481d95",
        "claim": "The reviewer's five coherence checks pass through the public createEditorView(editor, { document }): direct reads, plugin reads, EditorStatic and renderStaticHtml TOCs all show the document, and the source editor is unchanged."
      },
