        "sha256": "6c9d33ad788a5a94639ed5792b670a0901baca78b086f71c6f703290847b6e20",
        "claim": "Document views: reads, plugin reads, plugin APIs, value, no selection or last commit, read-only; named roots; refused updates and schema-invalid documents; document nodes resolve as targets; a captured source read during a view read throws while schema queries pass. Each law fails with its mechanism removed."
      },
      {
        "path": "packages/platejs/src/static/components/PlateStatic.spec.tsx",
        "sha256": "dab10ccc34d27def8475ff15e1be65942718c61fce7baa3a52f4ba7d74d2ed2f",
        "claim": "A TOC renders the document through EditorStatic and renderStaticHtml; a tail append renders only the new block; an in-place change renders from the first changed block; a TOC shows a later heading; a reused block drops a stale last-text decoration. Each fails under its mutation."
      },
      {
        "path": "packages/platejs/src/html/htmlConformance.spec.ts",
        "sha256": "a6693556dc04c7f41588f52a42d563b9deee7cfeb22d36a13408e8791bc1d9ee",
        "claim": "HTML round-trip conformance: 30 fixtures plus a false-claim self-test; a property lost without a report fails, and a reported property that survives fails."
      },
