        "claim": "S5 snapshot w (final tree): 8/8 cells pass; final text and HTML identical between arms; 0 page or console errors; streamed output equals a fresh render; React 62-82% below projection-2; static finals 8-39 ms."
      },
      {
        "path": "docs/research/probes/2026-09-28-conversion-boundary/lanes/s5/reuse/parity.json",
